   "source": [
    "# Sprint 1 — Flower Dataset Exploration & Understanding"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "814a4d70",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook examines the Oxford Flowers dataset (102 classes) using the\n",
    "**same EDA template** as `01_mushroom_dataset_exploration.ipynb`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Since VisionLab's goal is to run a single pipeline across different datasets,\n",
    "the section structure (Overview, Statistics, Class Distribution, Path\n",
    "Validation, Image Size Analysis, Sample Visualization, Integrity Checks) was\n",
    "deliberately kept identical to the mushroom notebook.\n",
    "\n",
    "Goals:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Understand the dataset structure\n",
    "- Validate image paths\n",
    "- Analyze class distribution (imbalance is expected here, unlike mushroom)\n",
    "- Analyze image resolutions\n",
    "- Detect corrupted or missing images\n",
    "- Produce a Sprint 1 summary comparing the two datasets"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "55810d40",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Imports"
   ]
  },
  {
