   "source": [
    "## 9. Image Resolution Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Unlike the mushroom dataset, Oxford Flowers doesn't look like it's been\n",
    "resized to a handful of fixed sizes — since it comes from original photos,\n",
    "we expect variable resolutions."
